window.docContents[126].resolve({"/Source Files and Modules/#whitespace":{"contents":"Lean 中的词法单元（token）之间可以用任意数量的 空白符 字符序列分隔。\n空白符可以是空格 (\" \", Unicode 'SPACE (SP)' (U+0020))、合法的换行序列，或注释。\n制表符和单独的回车（CR，未跟随换行）不是合法的空白符序列。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009源文件与模块\u0009具体语法","header":"5.2.1. 空白符","id":"/Source Files and Modules/#whitespace"},"/ValidatingProofs/#Lean-__________________--Validating-a-Lean-Proof--Re-Checking-Proofs-with--lean4checker--Instructions":{"contents":"使用 build 构建项目，在包含目标定理的模块上运行 lean4checker --fresh，并确认没有报告错误。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009验证 Lean 证明\u0009使用  lean4checker  重新检查证明","header":"操作说明","id":"/ValidatingProofs/#Lean-__________________--Validating-a-Lean-Proof--Re-Checking-Proofs-with--lean4checker--Instructions"},"/releases/v4.21.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___21___0-_LPAR_2025-06-30_RPAR_--Documentation":{"contents":"* #8199 增加了一份文档风格指南，其中既包含一般原则，\n也包含文档字符串特有的注意事项。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009发行说明\u0009Lean 4.21.0 (2025-06-30)","header":"文档","id":"/releases/v4.21.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___21___0-_LPAR_2025-06-30_RPAR_--Documentation"}});